State 0

    0 $accept: . start "<EOF>"
    1 start: . "<program>" program
    2      | . "<define>" define

    "<program>"  shift, and go to state 1
    "<define>"   shift, and go to state 2

    start  go to state 3


State 1

    1 start: "<program>" . program
    3 program: . program statement
    4        | . %empty

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (program)

    program  go to state 4


